"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4549850","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4521620","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:05Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4521620,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4521620","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:05Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4521620,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4521620","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:05Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4521620,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1847286114032280","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #07: Third Rail","summary":"Below the streets of Sin City there is a metro line nobody rides anymore. The lights still burn. The trains still run. Nobody knows who is driving them.For the full game, we are building a sequence down there, and we cannot wait to show you where it is heading.Two tracks, two trainsVictor drops into the tunnel with one goal: reach the control room at the far end and shut the line down. There is no platform and no safe ledge. The whole tunnel is just two parallel tracks, more than two hundred met","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:33:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032280","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:30:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1846651706673677","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #06: Roadkill","summary":"You told us one thing louder than anything else after the demo: you love the car.Victor's old Impala was never meant to be the star. It was a way to get from the street to the warehouse, a quiet place to breathe between nightmares. Then you started drifting it around the corners of Sin City just for fun, and we started asking ourselves a dangerous question What if the car could fight back?The Impala is a weapon nowIn the full game, the road is no longer safe and empty. The things that crawl out ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:17:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673677","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1846018067936424","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"update","title":"Deceptive Shadows: The First Demo Update","summary":"The demo has been out in the wild for a little while now, and you have been playing it, streaming it, and sending us notes. A lot of notes. Thank you. Every bug report, every I got stuck here message and every clip of something going wrong landed on our desk, and this update is the answer to them.It is a big one. Victor's car drives like a car now, the cemetery fights got a nasty new trick, the game runs lighter on modest PCs, and a long list of small annoyances is gone. Here is everything that ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:40:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936424","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1846018067932728","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO OUT NOW","summary":"The investigation begins. Our free demo is now available on Steam!Step into the dark world of Deceptive Shadows: Final Case, where every clue matters, every shadow hides a threat, and the truth is never quite what it seems.Take on the role of a paranormal detective, investigate a mysterious disappearance, confront demons, and survive using both weapons and supernatural powers.We're also excited to announce that will be participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest!This is just the beginning. We'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T09:41:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932728","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1845383656396477","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #04: Welcome to Sin City","summary":"Every story needs a city, and ours is Sin City. Four brutal murders in a few weeks. Then a seven year old girl, Klara Jenkins, taken from her own bed. By the time the demo begins, half the police force is out on the streets, and none of them know what they're looking for.Victor does. And he's driving. The carVictor's car is a long black sedan from the sixties, the kind of car that has outlived at least two owners and most of its paint. It started in Blender as a base model. Then we gave it a pai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:45:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396477","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1845383656380311","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #03: Loose Ends","summary":"For two devlogs we've talked about the things Victor is chasing. This time we want to talk about Victor himself: where he comes from, and the small details we've been fussing over so that he moves like that man and nobody else. A medium and a cop His mother was a medium. The phone rang at strange hours, strangers sat in the living room holding hands, and she talked to people who weren't there. Victor spent his childhood trying very hard not to notice that sometimes, somebody answered.His father ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T08:31:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1844751498225195","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #02 — The Evidence Room","summary":"Every detective needs a place to think. In Deceptive Shadows, that place is the Evidence Room: a cramped office with a corkboard, a desk and a bookshelf full of things nobody should have to read. After the graveyard chapter, Victor comes back here with his pockets full, and this is where the case starts to make sense. Or stops making sense. This week we're going behind the scenes of the room: what it's for, how the clues get there, and why we tore up the first version of the board. 🕵️ The idea M","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T16:26:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225195","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1844115010497023","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #01 — The Passengers","summary":"Welcome to the first devlog for Deceptive Shadows! From now on we'll post two of these a week, going behind the scenes on whatever we've been building. This first one is about the ending of our demo chapter, the Metro. It's the scene we're proudest of, and it's also the hardest one to show without spoiling it. 💡 The ideaIn most horror games, you know an enemy when you see one. We wanted to break that for a single scene.You walk down onto a subway platform late at night. There are people waiting.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T11:36:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1843481262697237","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Victor Can Now Dash!","summary":"Victor can now perform a ground dash while crouching, giving him more mobility and a faster way to escape danger.Move fast. Stay sharp. Survive. 🔥","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T10:22:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697237","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4521620-1842846814440343","game_id":"steam-4521620","kind":"announcement","title":"Deceptive Shadows Demo is Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"I'm excited to announce that Deceptive Shadows is coming to Steam Next Fest, with my demo launching very soon!Step into the shoes of a supernatural detective in Sin City, investigate a missing girl, and interrogate a chained demon. Fight your way through the darkness with guns, powerful spells, and occult abilities.Stay tuned. The shadows are coming.If you like supernatural mysteries and dark detective stories, add Deceptive Shadows to your Wishlist and help spread the word!See you in Sin City. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T13:33:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440343","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4521620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4521620":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4521620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z"},"4549850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4521620","app_id":4521620,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:39Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"256689abe0ae38416c4ee7a878669fd9339b614fc3074cdee3172971ffab9bcd","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"타락한 도시의 초자연 현상 탐정. 실종된 소녀, 쇠사슬에 묶인 악마, 그리고 거짓말로 가득한 도시. 평범한 수사처럼 들리나요? 전혀 아닙니다. 악마를 심문하고, 총과 마법으로 싸우며, 오컬트 퍼즐을 풀고 악마의 속임수에서 살아남으세요.","publishers":